# Volt Trades — Gap Implementation Protocol

Source: PDF v1.0 + CLAUDE.md + gap audit (Jul 2026). Follow this order. Do not skip ahead.

## Protocol (mandatory)

1. **One gap at a time.** Finish → prove → then next.
2. **Prove means:** API smoke/unit tests for new endpoints + frontend path works (manual or scripted). Prefer local/`pnpm` tests; rebuild Docker only when user runs Docker.
3. **Admin-first config.** If a feature needs business details (payment channels, gateway mode, blog, notifications copy), admin UI/settings must let staff set them — secrets stay in env, never in Prisma.
4. **No inventing product.** Community posts / subscription “plans” are out of PDF v1 scope.
5. **Money rules unchanged.** Ledger immutable; PAID only via verified webhook or finance confirm-manual; idempotency on financial writes.

