## Gap 1 acceptance

- Admin can enable/disable **manual** and **online** deposit modes in Settings.
- Manual still uses admin-published bank/MM details + finance confirm.
- Online calls gateway `createIntent` → checkout URL; PAID only via verified webhook.
- Secrets (`*_SECRET_KEY`, webhook secrets) only in env.
- Wallet deposit modal offers only enabled modes.
- Tests cover deposit-methods shape + gateway webhook verify (mock and/or real driver).
